entfield-introduction\" class=\"block block-fieldblock block-fieldblocknode\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      \n            <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-introduction field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Read our latest news and media releases, and access links to our Minister\u2019s news releases on the Beehive website.</span></p><p><span lang=\"mi\" dir=\"ltr\">P\u0101nuitia \u0101 m\u0101tou rongo k\u014drero hou me ng\u0101 p\u0101nuitanga arap\u0101ho, me te whakauru ki ng\u0101 hononga ki ng\u0101 p\u0101nuitanga rongo k\u014drero a t\u014d m\u0101tou Minita i runga i te pae tukutuku o te Whare M\u012bere.</span></p></div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container block block-views block-views-blockcontent-translations-block-1\" id=\"block-mchtheme-views-block-content-translations-block-1\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      <div></div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n          </aside>\n        </div>\n              <div id=\"main-wrapper\" class=\"layout-main-wrapper clearfix\">\n              <div id=\"main\" class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row row-offcanvas row-offcanvas-left clearfix\">\n            <main class=\"main-content col\" id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n              <section class=\"section\">\n                <a href=\"#main-content\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Main content\"></a>\n                  <div class=\"views-element-container block block-views block-views-blocknews-featured\" id=\"block-mchtheme-views-block-news-featured\">\n  \n      <h2 lang=en><span class='lang-primary' lang='en' dir='ltr' lang='en'>Featured news</span><span class='lang-separator'>/</span><span class='lang-additional' lang='mi' dir='ltr' lang='mi'>Ng\u0101 rongo k\u014drero motuhake</span></h2>\n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      <div><div class=\"view view-news view-id-news view-display-id-featured js-view-dom-id-d72bfa9d9a4e0b362c94f9cc3ae9614c80db660ff095d8902928417a5e48cd95\">\n  \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"view-content row\">\n          <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--promoted node--view-mode-card-primary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-07/hero_matariki-herenga-waka_credit-richie-mills.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Star and sun in night sky over ocean\" />\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/matariki-celebration-everyone\" hreflang=\"en\">Matariki is a celebration for everyone</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">This year marks the fifth observance of Matariki as a public holiday, highlighting the growing place of the M\u0101ori New Year within New Zealand\u2019s national calendar and the many ways it is celebrated across the country</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-07-02T15:38:28+12:00\" title=\"Thursday, July 2, 2026 - 15:38\" class=\"datetime\">2  July,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-primary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-04/hero-news-erebus-design-next-phase-view-render.jpg\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Rendered view of the National Erebus Memorial in Cracroft Reserve\" />\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/long-awaited-national-erebus-memorial-begins-construction\" hreflang=\"en\">Long-awaited National Erebus Memorial begins construction</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">Construction has started on the National Erebus Memorial, marking a significant step forward in honouring the 257 people who lost their lives in the Mt Erebus disaster on 28 November 1979</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-06-24T15:14:16+12:00\" title=\"Wednesday, June 24, 2026 - 15:14\" class=\"datetime\">24  June,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n  \n      </div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container block block-views block-views-blocknews-most-recent-news\" id=\"block-mchtheme-views-block-news-most-recent-news\">\n  \n      <h2 lang=en><span class='lang-primary' lang='en' dir='ltr' lang='en'>Most recent</span><span class='lang-separator'>/</span><span class='lang-additional' lang='mi' dir='ltr' lang='mi'>Ng\u0101 ihirangi hou</span></h2>\n    \n      <div class=\"content\">\n      <div><div class=\"view view-news view-id-news view-display-id-most_recent_news js-view-dom-id-dd89c715fcdbf2f492ac017f2690df121df2e18695fe13bca1f8e3cc2ee2fed8\">\n  \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"view-content row\">\n          <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--promoted node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/matariki-celebration-everyone\" hreflang=\"en\">Matariki is a celebration for everyone</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>This year marks the fifth observance of Matariki as a public holiday, highlighting the growing place of the M\u0101ori New Year within New Zealand\u2019s national calendar and the many ways it is celebrated across the country</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-07-02T15:38:28+12:00\" title=\"Thursday, July 2, 2026 - 15:38\" class=\"datetime\">2  July,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/long-awaited-national-erebus-memorial-begins-construction\" hreflang=\"en\">Long-awaited National Erebus Memorial begins construction</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Construction has started on the National Erebus Memorial, marking a significant step forward in honouring the 257 people who lost their lives in the Mt Erebus disaster on 28 November 1979</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-06-24T15:14:16+12:00\" title=\"Wednesday, June 24, 2026 - 15:14\" class=\"datetime\">24  June,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/new-zealand-korean-war-veterans-remembered-national-commemoration\" hreflang=\"en\">New Zealand Korean War veterans remembered at national commemoration</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>New Zealanders will gather once again on Thursday 25 June to commemorate the service and sacrifice of those who served during the Korean War, 1950\u20131953.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-06-16T14:30:09+12:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 16, 2026 - 14:30\" class=\"datetime\">16  June,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/volunteers-power-arts-culture-and-heritage-aotearoa\" hreflang=\"en\">Volunteers power arts, culture, and heritage in Aotearoa</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>We\u2019ve released a short report further exploring who volunteers in arts, culture, and heritage \u2013 what they do, and what motivates them. The report highlights the important role volunteers play in bringing events, creativity and community experiences to life.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-06-15T16:13:22+12:00\" title=\"Monday, June 15, 2026 - 16:13\" class=\"datetime\">15  June,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/budget-2026-information-arts-culture-heritage-and-sport\" hreflang=\"en\">Budget 2026: Information for arts, culture, heritage and sport</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Budget 2026 continues the Government\u2019s focus on fiscal restraint across public spending and delivering public services in a sustainable way.\u202f</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-05-28T14:52:00+12:00\" title=\"Thursday, May 28, 2026 - 14:52\" class=\"datetime\">28  May,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/nga-korero-tuku-iho-new-zealand-oral-history-grants-open-applications\" hreflang=\"en\">Ng\u0101 K\u014drero Tuku Iho, New Zealand Oral History Grants open for applications</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Ng\u0101 K\u014drero Tuku Iho, New Zealand Oral History Grants will open for applications on 2 June 2026</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-05-26T14:24:14+12:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 26, 2026 - 14:24\" class=\"datetime\">26  May,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/nga-tapuwae-trails-content-be-preserved-nzs-national-digital-archive\" hreflang=\"en\">Ng\u0101 Tapuwae Trails content to be preserved in NZ\u2019s national digital archive</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Manat\u016b Taonga Ministry for Culture and Heritage confirms it will preserve its website \u2018Ng\u0101 Tapuwae Trails\u2019, which presents First World War trails and location-based stories, after Anzac Day.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-04-20T13:41:06+12:00\" title=\"Monday, April 20, 2026 - 13:41\" class=\"datetime\">20  April,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/next-phase-reached-national-erebus-memorial-design\" hreflang=\"en\">Next phase reached in National Erebus Memorial design</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>The National Erebus Memorial has progressed from concept design to the next stage of design.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-04-20T09:49:30+12:00\" title=\"Monday, April 20, 2026 - 09:49\" class=\"datetime\">20  April,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n    \n\n<article class=\"node node--type-news node--view-mode-card-secondary clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\"><h3><a href=\"/news/opportunity-provide-creative-programmes-oranga-tamariki-residences\" hreflang=\"en\">Opportunity to provide creative programmes in Oranga Tamariki residences</a></h3></span>\n\n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-card-text field--type-string-long field--label-hidden field__item\">  <p>Oranga Tamariki is looking for suppliers who can design and deliver high\u2011quality structured programmes that support the wellbeing, development, and positive identity of tamariki and rangatahi in residential settings.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n      <span class=\"field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden\"><time datetime=\"2026-04-17T11:25:48+12:00\" title=\"Friday, April 17, 2026 - 11:25\" class=\"datetime\">17  April,  2026</time>\n</span>\n\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n      <div class=\"view-footer\">\n      1&ndash;9 of 236 news items\n    </div>\n  \n        <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"pagination-heading\">\n    <h4 id=\"pagination-heading\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Pagination</h4>\n      <ul class=\"js-pager__items pager__items pager-show-more\">\n        <li class=\"pager__item\">\n                      <a href=\"?page=1\" title=\"Go to next page\">Load more news</a>\n                  </li>\n      </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n      </div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n<article class=\"node node--type-landing-page node--view-mode-full clearfix\">\n  <header>\n    \n        \n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content clearfix\">\n    \n  </div>\n</article>\n\n\n              </section>\n            </main>\n                                  </div>\n        </div>\n          </div